{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_7d5f630cd576c60ceb970eb682533a265871f265386a62d220c502ec0b53c396"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: CLAUDE.md assigns Claude-specific model roles, designating one model as PM/coordinator that delegates implementation to Opus 5 subagents."}],"claim_ids":["clm_7d5f630cd576c60ceb970eb682533a265871f265386a62d220c502ec0b53c396"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:34:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_1f75b89fa75845bfbfd3b2502927ecd1","id":"pg_9029fc9ec98a56f58640a8e3198a04c9","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/arul28-ade-claude-md-4e14f9cdf0e4-a8e3198a04c9.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_97ba429f190f5627822804edf1a9b27e"],"title":"arul28/ADE/CLAUDE.md @ 4e14f9cdf0e4","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:34:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1f75b89fa75845bfbfd3b2502927ecd1"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_012ba13d2f4d1fd053e2a4741a45e129204ae2293fcd2b9c4dd13c9dbf1aecc8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is licensed AGPL-3.0, while the @ade-dev/sdk and @ade-dev/chat-ui npm packages are MIT and an ADE Runtime Embedding Exception covers shipping the runtime binary."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2c94e3b8ec1f9d816c000a00c64b432928f2615611fcfa1b78bed6a3a7562ba0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repo contains apps/ade-cli (Brain, CLI, and ade code TUI), apps/desktop (Electron), apps/ios (SwiftUI), and apps/web (website and downloads)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_319c7100f3669aad8b19cc32ec4f3bfb641c3040da6efacc725033c7c684e915"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"There is no Linux desktop app yet; Linux can run only the Brain, and the Windows desktop app is beta with some macOS features unavailable and ARM64 unsupported."},{"claim_ids":["clm_391a72e5e594caef77f2e63ad172d47e3c3ef1967208491db6d14a80506b64cb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"ADE runs Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Factory Droid, and OpenCode in one workspace reachable from any machine, the web, or a mobile app, and is described as free."},{"claim_ids":["clm_39fb79aa6e34a28abb3e1c9877d6af6cf773a596633261506314d3165df81380"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"ADE is local-first: the Brain is the always-on process owning the project catalog, sync websocket, and authority to run things; project data lives in .ade/ per repo and machine state in ~/.ade."},{"claim_ids":["clm_428422f5bf33b6035bd67118e332a58b18b1f8448fc011b768351955b1b021ce"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The ade CLI offers subcommands such as desktop, brain status, code, lanes create, prs checks, and actions list, sharing the same binary that runs the Brain."},{"claim_ids":["clm_51b6229c10720b1fa2bc44b7ab902b8ad05ad60aa405094e14644448b7a9e599"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"ade connect links a machine to an ADE account, with flags --status --text, --headless for SSH device flow, and --no-login for local/LAN-only service setup."},{"claim_ids":["clm_702a2f27ac3b1c92b23ba7a3bb13943dec811f47852df38e914cc057f7afd860"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The installer supports overrides including ADE_VERSION, ADE_INSTALL_DIR, ADE_HOME, ADE_INSTALL_NO_PATH, and ADE_INSTALL_NO_PROMPT, and skips prompts when no terminal is attached."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b674c37448cbbdfc81ad60e44f7457796b14d5e5a754a210e102d627394e1c4a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Mobile connections prefer LAN, then Tailscale, falling back to ADE's own relay service; without an account, pairing is possible via QR/link, LAN/Tailscale scan, or SSH."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e2d3c884f44e5bd60f5b2f4685dc485d194085cb4c761bfabb917e00970e6a09"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: validation uses desktop and CLI typecheck/test/build commands, with the large desktop suite sharded and the smallest relevant subset run first."}],"claim_ids":["clm_012ba13d2f4d1fd053e2a4741a45e129204ae2293fcd2b9c4dd13c9dbf1aecc8","clm_2c94e3b8ec1f9d816c000a00c64b432928f2615611fcfa1b78bed6a3a7562ba0","clm_319c7100f3669aad8b19cc32ec4f3bfb641c3040da6efacc725033c7c684e915","clm_391a72e5e594caef77f2e63ad172d47e3c3ef1967208491db6d14a80506b64cb","clm_39fb79aa6e34a28abb3e1c9877d6af6cf773a596633261506314d3165df81380","clm_428422f5bf33b6035bd67118e332a58b18b1f8448fc011b768351955b1b021ce","clm_51b6229c10720b1fa2bc44b7ab902b8ad05ad60aa405094e14644448b7a9e599","clm_702a2f27ac3b1c92b23ba7a3bb13943dec811f47852df38e914cc057f7afd860","clm_b674c37448cbbdfc81ad60e44f7457796b14d5e5a754a210e102d627394e1c4a","clm_e2d3c884f44e5bd60f5b2f4685dc485d194085cb4c761bfabb917e00970e6a09"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:34:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_1f75b89fa75845bfbfd3b2502927ecd1","id":"pg_eb04f2955dc558c991b296b747dd346d","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/arul28-ade-readme-md-4e14f9cdf0e4-96b747dd346d.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_